XORGPROTO
=========

A git submodule (see docs/contrib.md), not a copy of the sources:

url    = https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/proto/xorgproto.git
tag    = xorgproto-2025.1
commit = c18d2bc22813793bba7f0e4e603c0104d7724802
date   = 2025-12-18

Headers only: include/X11 (Xos.h, Xfuncs.h, Xproto.h, fonts/fontstruct.h
and the rest) for bdftopcf, built by tools/desktop/build-fonts.sh. Nothing
is installed from it: the X server and the other X clients still use
DPorts' xorgproto until the X stack is moved (docs/desktop-xlibre.md).
Nothing is written into the submodule.

Licence: see COPYING-* in the tree (one per protocol).
